# --- Captured third-party design data: never committed ---
# data/ holds the atlases measured from other people's sites and files (tokens, style samples, opt-in screenshots)
# plus the viewer server's runtime files. It is regenerable from the sources, may name those sources, and is not
# ours to publish. CI fails when anything under data/ is tracked (.github/workflows/ci.yml).
/data/

# --- Regenerable: dependencies, build and test output, release packages ---
node_modules/
/dist/
/release/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.zip
*.log

# --- Secret: local environment files ---
.env
.env.*

# --- Machine-local: OS and editor files, local code-index caches, agent notes ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
.repowise/
tasks/lessons.md
